cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or its findings, please cite it as below."
title: "Singapore flash-flood nowcasting with generative diffusion"
authors:
  - alias: beese54
type: software
license: MIT
date-released: "2026-09-27"
abstract: >-
  A v-prediction diffusion nowcaster for Singapore rain radar (NEA, 0.29 km, 5-min), producing
  8-member ensembles at 30/60/90-minute leads, with an evaluation against persistence that includes
  pooled FSS, CRPS and out-of-sample flash-flood reports. Heavy-rain skill is a documented limitation.
keywords:
  - nowcasting
  - diffusion models
  - weather radar
  - flash floods
  - Singapore
